，湯頭有加些許辣蒜泥提味，玉米鮮嫩，玉子蛋是極品，溏心中透著油光，難怪單賣要$40\n\n元祖叉燒拉麵$340\n叉燒沒入味也無炙燒，感覺像川燙的豬肉帶著些許腥味，湯頭清淡無記憶點，幸好桌上提供辣肉醬、蒜泥、辣椒醬、自磨芝麻、辣椒粉，可自行調整，辣肉醬很加分\n\n莓果高麗菜$130\n使用蔓越莓微酸微甜，適合淡淡的春天，清爽特別又好吃\n\n豆干$50\n只有一個稍大豆干的份量拌著香菜，真的很貴，但是鹹甜香適中很入味，是下次會糾結要不要再點的小菜\n\n整體來說是會再次光臨也會推薦朋友的麵店\n歡迎追蹤IG:lynn._.foodie\n#美食評論老實說",null,[0,39]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4696880296521392186/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kVnBMTTNGblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4696880296521392186/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kVnBMTTNGblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4696880296521392186/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kVnBMTTNGblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4696880296521392186/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kVnBMTTNGblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4696880296521392186/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kVnBMTTNGblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4696880296521392186/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kVnBMTTNGblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,8784,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNodVpLM3FnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x34e0098ec960f2bb!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIChuZK3qgE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNodVpLM3FnRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNodVpLM3FnRRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNodVpLM2FnEhNDZ3dJeF9LSG9BWVE4SzJCM2dFGi0KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ2h1WkszNmdFEhJDZ3NJeXNPOG53WVE2T3o4QXciEgkAAAAAAAAAABG78mDJjgngNCoLMFotVV82UWs0UWs\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjsvdPswdKWAxVfZ_UHHQNiI68QoykImwIoHw"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwju09vswdKWAxW5eV4EHaOBBxUQ0pMFCJoBKAc"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjsvdPswdKWAxVfZ_U